WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.333 --> 00:00:01.817
Where did you go today?

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:06.778
Tap Start. Momera GO keeps your route, even with no signal.

3
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:12.015
Photos, videos, voice memos, notes... pinned right where they happened.

4
00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:15.784
Follow a trail. Then tap Hike Back to find your way home.

5
00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:21.364
Turn your Google Timeline, or a handful of photos, into a journey.

6
00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:25.761
Watch your day play back, then save your trails and journeys as videos.

7
00:00:26.033 --> 00:00:29.458
Momera GO. From where you go, to memory forever.
